      <memberdef kind="function" id="classcsmp_1_1_v_set_converter_1afdbdb8cae8f0840f8f4c59d7b1ee1fb1" prot="public" static="no" const="no" explicit="no" inline="no" virt="non-virtual">
        <type>void</type>
        <definition>void csmp::VSetConverter&lt; dim &gt;::ConvertLinearToQuadraticTetrahedra</definition>
        <argsstring>(VSet&lt; dim &gt; &amp;)</argsstring>
        <name>ConvertLinearToQuadraticTetrahedra</name>
        <qualifiedname>csmp::VSetConverter::ConvertLinearToQuadraticTetrahedra</qualifiedname>
        <param>
          <type><ref refid="classcsmp_1_1_v_set" kindref="compound">VSet</ref>&lt; dim &gt; &amp;</type>
          <defname>vset</defname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>create 10-noded tetrahedra from 4-noded ones </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>void <ref refid="classcsmp_1_1_v_set_converter_1afdbdb8cae8f0840f8f4c59d7b1ee1fb1" kindref="member">VSetConverter&lt;dim&gt;::ConvertLinearToQuadraticTetrahedra( VSet&lt;dim&gt;&amp; vset )</ref></para>
<para><linebreak/>
 <bold>Description</bold> </para>
<para>Interpolates midside node locations onto the sides of the quadratic tetrahedron and adds these points as nodes to the <ref refid="classcsmp_1_1_v_set" kindref="compound">VSet&lt;dim&gt;</ref> which is returned. <linebreak/>
</para>
<para>The node numbering of the tetrahedron is: <verbatim>      ^ t
      |
      |

    4 o
      | \
      |   \
   10 o     o 9
      |      \
</verbatim> 8 o | \ 1 o <ndash/> o <mdash/> o 3 --&gt; s / 7 / <linebreak/>
 5 o o 6 / / o 2 <linebreak/>
 r <linebreak/>
</para>
<para><linebreak/>
 <bold>Input</bold> <bold>Arguments</bold> </para>
<para>A reference to the <ref refid="classcsmp_1_1_v_set" kindref="compound">VSet&lt;dim&gt;</ref> which shall be modified by the function. <linebreak/>
</para>
<para><linebreak/>
 <bold>Output</bold> <bold>Arguments</bold> &amp; Return Value</para>
<para>The modified <ref refid="classcsmp_1_1_v_set" kindref="compound">VSet&lt;dim&gt;</ref> in returned into the first method argument. <linebreak/>
</para>
<para><linebreak/>
 <bold>Implementation</bold> </para>
<para><linebreak/>
 <bold>Application</bold> </para>
<para>To facilitate computations with quadratic tetrahedral elements on the basis of simple tetrahedral element meshes. <linebreak/>
</para>
<para><linebreak/>
 <bold>Messages</bold> </para>
<para>tested: O.K. SKM 4/3/02 </para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
